    "description": "Flipper Zero is a portable multi-tool for geeks in a toy-like body. This app helps to manage your data on the device, organize keys and share them with other Flipper Zero users.\r\n\r\nAlso available is a Wear OS app that allows you to remotely run your keys on Flipper. Important: The Wear OS app requires the smartphone app to function.",
